# Gemini API key for the optional live AI (CircuitGuide > liveAi). Never commit the real key.
# 1) Copy this file to .env and paste your key after GEMINI_API_KEY=   2) Run: powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File tools/apply-env.ps1
# 3) In Lens Studio set CircuitGuide > liveAi ON (the Inspector geminiKey field, if filled, wins over .env).   Rotate the key if it ever leaks.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
